  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<p>Hi&nbsp; &nbsp;all</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">《三界仙缘录》活动于3月14日0点-3月18日24点上线，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">现同步Day3数据情况：</span></p><p><br /></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">1、目标完成度</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">消耗目标3000万钻，活动上线3天，消耗2028万钻，目标完成度67.61%。</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23,43,77);\">活动消耗2028万，其中普通礼物消耗1218万钻，小映礼物消耗643万钻，功能消耗167万钻，活动占主板消耗20.61%，占礼物消耗34.16%。</span></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>消耗目标</td><td>消耗钻石数</td><td>目标完成度</td><td>时间进度</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>30,000,000</td><td>20,282,895</td><td>67.61%</td><td>60.00%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>日期</td><td>主板消耗</td><td>礼物消耗</td><td>活动消耗</td><td>普通礼物</td><td>小映礼物消耗</td><td>功能消耗</td><td>活动占主板</td><td>礼物消耗占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20260314</td><td>29,750,910&nbsp;</td><td>17,132,859&nbsp;</td><td>7,354,064&nbsp;</td><td>4,039,272&nbsp;</td><td>2,480,832&nbsp;</td><td>833,960&nbsp;</td><td>24.72%</td><td>38.06%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20260315</td><td>34,544,899&nbsp;</td><td>20,499,187&nbsp;</td><td>6,989,534&nbsp;</td><td>4,558,326&nbsp;</td><td>1,974,848&nbsp;</td><td>456,360&nbsp;</td><td>20.23%</td><td>31.87%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>20260316</td><td>34,208,710&nbsp;</td><td>16,895,215&nbsp;</td><td>5,955,972&nbsp;</td><td>3,591,344&nbsp;</td><td>1,984,288&nbsp;</td><td>380,340&nbsp;</td><td>17.41%</td><td>33.00%</td></tr><tr><td>合计</td><td>98,504,519&nbsp;</td><td>54,527,261&nbsp;</td><td>20,299,570&nbsp;</td><td>12,188,942&nbsp;</td><td>6,439,968&nbsp;</td><td>1,670,660&nbsp;</td><td>20.61%</td><td>34.16%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><strong>2、场景主播分布：</strong></p><p>全部礼物，派对和秀场主播的收礼占比为：69:31，其中派对厅消耗1291万钻，秀场厅消耗571万钻。</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 290.0px;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 99.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 98.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 92.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>场景</td><td>消耗钻石数</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>派对</td><td>12,914,615&nbsp;</td><td>69.33%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>秀场</td><td>5,714,295&nbsp;</td><td>30.67%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>18,628,910&nbsp;</td><td><br /></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>3、各层级主播收礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧收礼的主播主要集中BN层级，秀场侧收礼的主播主要集中在B层级。</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 544.034px;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 159.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 98.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 95.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 96.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 94.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>主播61日动态层级</td><td>派对</td><td>占比</td><td>秀场</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>1,172,720&nbsp;</td><td>6.43%</td><td>916,127&nbsp;</td><td>5.03%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>145,017&nbsp;</td><td>0.80%</td><td>524,725&nbsp;</td><td>2.88%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>3,071,205&nbsp;</td><td>16.85%</td><td>2,954,106&nbsp;</td><td>16.21%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B-</td><td>2,039,908&nbsp;</td><td>11.19%</td><td>551,144&nbsp;</td><td>3.02%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>2,464,625&nbsp;</td><td>13.52%</td><td>485,527&nbsp;</td><td>2.66%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>624,987&nbsp;</td><td>3.43%</td><td>92,856&nbsp;</td><td>0.51%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>3,178,368&nbsp;</td><td>17.44%</td><td>2,789&nbsp;</td><td>0.02%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>12,696,830&nbsp;</td><td>69.67%</td><td>5,527,274&nbsp;</td><td>30.33%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><strong>4、各层级用户送礼数据</strong></p><p>派对侧送礼的用户主要集中BD层级，秀场侧送礼的用户主要集中在BD层级。</p><table class=\"relative-table\" style=\"width: 457.159px;\"><colgroup class=\"\"><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 114.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 93.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 81.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 90.0px;\" /><col class=\"\" style=\"width: 80.0px;\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td>用户25日动态层级</td><td>派对</td><td>占比</td><td>秀场</td><td>占比</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>S</td><td>7,362&nbsp;</td><td>0.04%</td><td>813,056&nbsp;</td><td>4.36%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>A</td><td>642,332&nbsp;</td><td>3.45%</td><td>311,451&nbsp;</td><td>1.67%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>B</td><td>4,009,727&nbsp;</td><td>21.52%</td><td>2,209,738&nbsp;</td><td>11.86%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>C</td><td>1,607,620&nbsp;</td><td>8.63%</td><td>683,674&nbsp;</td><td>3.67%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>D</td><td>3,985,683&nbsp;</td><td>21.40%</td><td>1,184,779&nbsp;</td><td>6.36%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>E</td><td>1,927,293&nbsp;</td><td>10.35%</td><td>348,289&nbsp;</td><td>1.87%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>F</td><td>337,379&nbsp;</td><td>1.81%</td><td>52,510&nbsp;</td><td>0.28%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>N</td><td>397,219&nbsp;</td><td>2.13%</td><td>110,798&nbsp;</td><td>0.59%</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>总计</td><td>12,914,615&nbsp;</td><td>69.33%</td><td>5,714,295&nbsp;</td><td>30.67%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p>5、繁花盛宴</p><p>繁花盛宴与水果总动员消耗对比，兑换人数提升59%，日均消耗下降72%，arppu下降82%。</p><table><tbody class=\"\"><tr class=\"\"><td><br /></td><td>兑换uv</td><td>消耗钻石</td><td>arppu</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>水果总动员</td><td>1,239&nbsp;</td><td>2,035,187&nbsp;</td><td>1,643&nbsp;</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>繁花</td><td>1,977&nbsp;</td><td>556,887&nbsp;</td><td>282&nbsp;</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>差值</td><td>738&nbsp;</td><td>-1,478,300&nbsp;</td><td>-1,361&nbsp;</td></tr><tr class=\"\"><td>环比</td><td>59.54%</td><td>-72.64%</td><td>-82.85%</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p>",
